{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41539","headline":"登润州城 · 江爲","name":"登润州城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天末江城晚，登临客望迷。\n春潮平岛屿，残雨隔虹霓。\n鸟与孤帆远，烟和独树低。\n乡山何处是，目断广陵西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}